```
from typing import Annotated
from kedi.typesafe import Rubric
Quality = Annotated[
    float,
    "Assess answer correctness against the supplied reference",
    Rubric(["Incorrect", "Partly correct", "Fully correct"]),
]
```
> adapter: pydantic
> model: typesafe/jev-latest
@judge(evidence: str) -> float:
  >> Evaluate <evidence>. Quality: [quality: `Quality`].
  = `quality / 2`

@eval: judge:
  > data: cases:
    = `[('Reference: Ankara. Answer: Ankara.', None)]`
